# The repository's text is LF, in the repository and in every checkout, as in
# dsh's own repository: the kernel is imported byte for byte, and the digests
# and byte comparisons (Typert source digests, an agent's digest and release
# lock, the release gate's replay of a baseline, test goldens) must see the
# same bytes on every host. Without this, Git for Windows (core.autocrlf=true)
# checks text out with CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
